            <title>[LU-17559] debian --enable-multiple-lnds repackaging script should be version independant</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17559</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;debian --enable-multiple-lnds repackaging script should be version independant&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently the script fails expecting a "DEBIAN" sub-directory to be unpacked from the the deb package. This is dependent on the version of the deb package.&lt;br/&gt;
It can simply create the directory and proceed creating packages for each lnd.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
